    {
      "body": "@yuan-luo you wrote this ReplaySSM help in #28451, so tagging you. This corrects the \"no_buffer (the default)\" wording in the --enable-linear-replayssm help and in its validation error. The flag default is auto, which resolves to extra_buffer when overlap scheduling is on, and the validator then rejects extra_buffer, so the default the help points at is exactly the one that fails. Strings only, no behavior change. Could you take a look when you have a moment? cc @yizhang2077 as linear-attn codeowner.",
